15:14.580 --> 15:17.250
Forget it. It's a problem for adults only.

15:17.500 --> 15:20.830
Man, if only I could get some chomchomp.

15:20.830 --> 15:24.750
Then I could make a really awesome
meal for you and Lum to eat.

15:26.920 --> 15:28.540
Should I get some for ya?

15:28.540 --> 15:29.750
Will you? Really?

15:29.750 --> 15:31.040
<b>WIGGLE WADDLE</b>

15:33.580 --> 15:35.790
Sure. It'll take me about ten days or so, though!

15:35.790 --> 15:37.210
Ten days?!

15:38.170 --> 15:40.000
I can't wait that long.

15:40.000 --> 15:41.880
We've only got three days until the yaminabe.

15:41.880 --> 15:43.170
It'll be too late.

15:43.170 --> 15:45.580
I'm gonna have to make do
with Earth food somehow.

16:01.920 --> 16:03.250
Is something the matter?

16:03.250 --> 16:04.380
Nope, nothing.

16:04.380 --> 16:06.290
<b>RAMEN</b>

16:12.210 --> 16:14.210
Can I get some seconds, please?

16:14.210 --> 16:15.380
Sure thing!
I don't believe this!<b></b>

16:15.380 --> 16:15.880
I don't believe this!

16:15.880 --> 16:18.750
She just gobbles down all sorts of
Earth food like a freakin' horse!

16:19.170 --> 16:20.170
Lum.

16:21.420 --> 16:22.830
Does it taste good?

16:22.830 --> 16:24.210
It doesn't taste like anything!

16:24.210 --> 16:25.210
Huh?

16:25.210 --> 16:27.580
All the food on this planet
has such mild flavoring,

16:27.580 --> 16:29.580
I don't really know what they taste like!

16:29.920 --> 16:33.040
But, since this is your treat, darling...

16:33.710 --> 16:36.210
I think that it's all super delicious!

16:36.420 --> 16:39.250
Lum... I'm truly speechless...

16:39.580 --> 16:40.790
Who the hell said I was treating you?!

16:40.790 --> 16:41.630
Here you go. Another mega sized chashu ramen.
Who the hell said I was treating you?!<b></b>

16:41.630 --> 16:43.250
Here you go. Another mega sized chashu ramen.
Well, you invited me here!<b></b>

16:43.250 --> 16:44.710
That means you're paying!

16:44.710 --> 16:46.790
Quit pigging out on food
that you can't even taste!

16:46.790 --> 16:48.290
That's just stupid!
Thanks for waiting!<b></b>

16:48.290 --> 16:50.500
Here's the gyoza deluxe with extra garlic!

16:50.500 --> 16:52.580
I still need to keep my tummy full!

16:55.960 --> 16:57.210
This is awesome!

16:57.210 --> 16:59.710
I told you! They just added this
to the menu recently.

16:59.710 --> 17:00.830
Lum?

17:02.420 --> 17:03.920
H-hey! Come back!

17:03.920 --> 17:05.130
Pay your share!

17:07.290 --> 17:09.040
Wait a second...

17:10.460 --> 17:11.790
Gyoza?

17:12.080 --> 17:13.330
Th-that's it!

17:14.130 --> 17:17.130
Lum must hate the smell of garlic!

17:21.040 --> 17:22.710
What the hell, man!

17:25.420 --> 17:26.920
Those were ours...

17:30.000 --> 17:32.500
Eating those 30 gyoza should give me
all the ammo I need against her!

17:32.880 --> 17:33.960
Hey, Lum!

17:37.790 --> 17:40.960
It smells awful! Please no more!

17:41.920 --> 17:44.790
Take that! Now you know how I feel!

17:44.790 --> 17:48.040
I'm sorry! I won't cook anymore!

17:48.670 --> 17:50.210
This will totally work!

17:50.830 --> 17:52.290
Oh hey!

17:52.290 --> 17:54.420
Can I have your digits and address, cutie?

17:52.710 --> 17:53.750
<b>FOOOSH!</b>

17:55.290 --> 17:57.000
Stay away from me!

17:57.500 --> 17:59.380
Oh come on! At least tell me your name!

17:57.880 --> 17:59.000
<b>FOOOSH!</b>

17:59.380 --> 18:00.540
You reek!

18:00.920 --> 18:03.040
Hey, sweet thing!
How about we get together and-

18:01.170 --> 18:02.670
<b>FOOOSH!</b>

18:03.040 --> 18:03.880
NOOO!

18:04.500 --> 18:06.380
Wow! How you doin', baby?

18:04.920 --> 18:06.170
<b>FOOOSH!</b>

18:06.380 --> 18:07.330
Back off!

18:07.330 --> 18:08.920
Why hello there, gorgeous!

18:08.040 --> 18:09.130
<b>FOOOSH!</b>

18:11.790 --> 18:14.330
Oh crap. This isn't the time
to be picking up chicks.

18:14.330 --> 18:16.170
I have to save this garlic breath for later!

18:32.830 --> 18:34.790
Isn't this air freshener great?

18:34.790 --> 18:35.920
What the?

18:35.920 --> 18:39.080
Just think about it, nobody likes a guy
who goes around stinking up the place.

18:39.080 --> 18:40.580
MIND YOUR OWN DAMN BUSINESS!

18:55.580 --> 18:56.960
Bingo!

18:56.960 --> 18:58.670
It's too weak when put in gyoza.

18:58.670 --> 19:00.250
So I'll use it raw!

19:00.630 --> 19:02.580
She's gonna get a mouthful!

19:05.040 --> 19:06.750
Well, everyone.

19:06.750 --> 19:09.880
As we decided last week,
it's time for the yaminabe competition!

19:09.880 --> 19:13.130
The rules are simple: we all put
the food we brought into the pot.

19:13.130 --> 19:16.580
And whatever you grab with
your chopsticks MUST be eaten!

19:17.000 --> 19:18.500
Okay, lights out!

19:19.670 --> 19:21.960
I prefer to add something
that at least tastes good,

19:21.960 --> 19:23.790
since we have to eat it ourselves.

19:24.080 --> 19:27.080
I have no idea if I can stomach
the food that commoners eat.

19:27.080 --> 19:29.210
So I'm playing it safe with:

19:29.210 --> 19:31.540
truffles, mushrooms, shark fin,
and edible bird's nest.

19:31.540 --> 19:34.040
It's time! Get ready to suffer, Lum!

19:31.540 --> 19:35.960
<b>DUUUMP</b>

19:34.040 --> 19:35.960
Here's a big, fat helping of raw garlic!

19:38.040 --> 19:42.460
Just gotta leave it near someone else,
so I don't have to eat it...

19:42.460 --> 19:46.420
Rice balls, rice cakes, mugwort dumplings,
monaka wafers, jelly...

19:46.420 --> 19:51.210
Some habanero, black pepper, chili oil,
curry powder, chili peppers!

19:46.420 --> 19:53.630
<b>SPLISH</b>

19:46.420 --> 19:53.630
<b>SPLASH</b>

19:51.210 --> 19:54.250
Yum, yum, and even more yum!

19:54.250 --> 19:55.460
Oh, that's right!

19:55.460 --> 19:57.670
There's one more thing I wanted to add!

19:57.670 --> 19:59.250
This little guy right here!

19:59.250 --> 20:01.250
Now it's perfect!

20:01.750 --> 20:02.630
<b>KERPLUNK!</b>

20:03.000 --> 20:04.420
<b>WIGGLE WADDLE</b>

20:05.500 --> 20:07.630
What a stroke of luck!

20:07.630 --> 20:10.500
Can't believe I ran across
a traveling vegetable salesman!

20:10.500 --> 20:12.710
All right! Is everyone finished?

20:12.710 --> 20:14.710
Okay, time to let it boil for a bit!

20:14.710 --> 20:16.380
They're cooking something.

20:16.710 --> 20:18.040
Perfect timing.

20:22.080 --> 20:23.670
Okay, everyone!

20:23.670 --> 20:25.040
Ready and...!

20:25.040 --> 20:27.210
Let's dig in!

20:28.000 --> 20:28.630
<b>CRUNCH</b>

20:28.630 --> 20:29.290
<b>MUNCH</b>

20:28.630 --> 20:29.290
<b>MUNCH</b>

20:29.290 --> 20:29.920
<b>GOBBLE</b>

20:29.290 --> 20:29.920
<b>GOBBLE</b>

20:29.920 --> 20:30.500
<b>GNASH</b>

20:32.540 --> 20:32.920
<b>CLUNK!</b>

20:33.040 --> 20:33.380
<b>CLATTER!</b>

20:33.710 --> 20:34.040
<b>SLAM!</b>

20:34.170 --> 20:34.670
<b>PLOP!</b>

20:37.880 --> 20:40.500
What on earth is this sinister smell?

20:40.500 --> 20:43.670
Cripes! You darn kids!

20:43.670 --> 20:45.880
You're supposed to be doing
a recreational activity right now!

20:45.880 --> 20:47.380
No sleeping!

20:47.750 --> 20:50.460
Difgusting... thif commur furd...

20:51.670 --> 20:55.630
Ugh. Guess I found another food
that I really don't like...

20:51.670 --> 20:55.630
<b>NIBBLE</b>

20:56.380 --> 20:57.630
Hey. Rugrat.

20:57.630 --> 20:59.130
Whaf ish this?

20:59.130 --> 21:01.920
You're the one who said
you wanted some chomchomp!

21:01.920 --> 21:03.790
Thish is chomchomp?!

21:04.630 --> 21:06.170
Whoa, what on earth?!

21:11.500 --> 21:13.880
Be careful when you play
yaminabe at home, kids!

21:16.170 --> 21:19.080
Mada tarinai ai shitetaiyaiya

21:19.080 --> 21:22.080
Anata igai kangaerarenai ya

21:22.080 --> 21:24.830
Atashi o suite atashi dake mite

21:24.830 --> 21:27.830
Mou anata no zui made aishiteru

21:39.000 --> 21:42.000
Hitomi no okusoko dare o matteru no?

21:42.000 --> 21:44.960
Anata wa yokogao shika misetenai wa

21:44.960 --> 21:46.380
Oshiete hoshii no

21:46.380 --> 21:48.710
Give me love give me love dake

21:50.500 --> 21:53.580
Donna hoshi yori mo kono chikyuujou ni

21:53.580 --> 21:56.420
Anata ga itakara sui ochite kita no

21:56.420 --> 21:58.630
Kotaete hoshii no aimai o

21:58.630 --> 21:59.710
I need you o

21:59.710 --> 22:00.960
Aitai nankai shitai

22:00.960 --> 22:02.500
Ai shiaitai

22:02.500 --> 22:04.170
Nee nee darling darling

22:04.170 --> 22:05.540
Uchuu no hate made

22:05.540 --> 22:07.040
Nee nee darling darling

22:07.040 --> 22:08.330
Hanareta koi mo

22:08.330 --> 22:10.830
Hoshi to tsuki nutte maite

22:10.830 --> 22:12.830
Daki yosete yo

22:12.830 --> 22:13.790
Datte

22:13.790 --> 22:16.500
Mada tarinai ai shitetaiyaiya

22:16.500 --> 22:19.460
Anata igai kangaerarenai ya

22:19.460 --> 22:22.290
Atashi o suite atashi dake mite

22:22.290 --> 22:25.130
Mou anata no zui made aishiteru

22:25.130 --> 22:28.040
Mada dame dame doko ni mo nigecha iya

22:28.040 --> 22:30.880
Anata to iu hoshi de mawaritai no

22:30.880 --> 22:33.750
Nee kocchi muite mata soppo muite

22:33.750 --> 22:36.920
Soredemo tada anata ga suki dakara

22:37.130 --> 22:38.580
Zettai zettai

22:38.580 --> 22:39.960
Biribri shichau no

22:39.960 --> 22:41.500
Genkai genkai

22:41.500 --> 22:42.920
Ai tarinai

22:45.580 --> 22:50.330
<b>Magic Realm!</b>

22:45.580 --> 22:50.330
<b>Jungle of Terror Pickled</b>

22:46.290 --> 22:48.290
On the next episode of "Urusei Yatsura"!
